<BaseLayout title="Website Terms" description="Terms governing use of the MotoOptix product sourcing and wholesale inquiry website.">
  <header class="policy-hero"><p class="kicker dark"><span></span> Legal</p><h1>Website Terms</h1><p>Last updated: August 9, 2026</p></header>
  <article class="policy-content">
    <p>These terms apply to use of the MotoOptix website. Legal entity, address and governing-law details must be completed before public launch.</p>
    <h2>Information, not a binding offer</h2><p>Website content is provided for general product-sourcing information. Product availability, specifications, prices, minimum quantities, lead times, branding options and compliance documentation are not binding until confirmed in a written quotation for an identified configuration.</p>
    <h2>Product configurations</h2><p>Products shown on this site are supply platforms that may have multiple component combinations and supplier revisions. Images and category descriptions do not guarantee that every listed option is available together. A sample or quotation should identify the exact configuration under consideration.</p>
    <h2>Samples and testing</h2><p>A sample represents the supplied configuration and does not by itself guarantee the characteristics of a later production batch. Any inspection, testing, acceptance criteria or reference sample for an order must be agreed in writing.</p>
    <h2>Compliance and market suitability</h2><p>Buyers are responsible for confirming import, labeling, radio, privacy, road-use and product-compliance requirements in their destination markets. Available supplier documents will be identified during quotation; their existence should not be inferred from general website content.</p>
    <h2>Intellectual property</h2><p>MotoOptix branding, original website copy and design may not be reproduced for commercial use without permission. Product names and marks belonging to other parties remain the property of their respective owners.</p>
    <h2>External links and service availability</h2><p>We are not responsible for the content or availability of third-party services. We may update, suspend or remove website content as product availability and sourcing relationships change.</p>
    <h2>Commercial terms</h2><p>Payment, production, delivery, inspection, warranty, defect handling, liability and dispute terms for an order are governed by the applicable quotation, pro forma invoice or signed agreement—not by this website page.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2><p>Formal business and legal contact information will be inserted before the production website is opened to public inquiries.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
